     <div class="w-col w-col-6"><a class="faqs links" href="#">Can I setup recurring charges for my customers in Relay?</a><a class="faqs links" href="#">When are funds deposited into my bank account?</a><a class="faqs links" href="#">Who handles receipts and refunds?</a><a class="faqs links" href="#">Can I create keywords and track keywords?</a><a class="faqs links" href="#">What is the difference between lists &amp; segments?</a><a class="faqs links" href="#">How do I setup automated drip messages?</a><a class="faqs links" href="#">Will you provide me with a new phone number?</a><a class="faqs links" href="#">Can I use my existing business phone number in Relay?</a><a class="faqs links" href="#">How do I connect Facebook Messenger to Relay?</a><a class="faqs links" href="#">How do I get notified of unread messages?</a></div>
